WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.917 --> 00:00:04.686
DRAWING FROM THE SUMMIT IN

00:00:04.453 --> 00:00:05.787
SINGAPORE.

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:09.658
WE ARE IN SEOUL TONIGHT.

00:00:05.921 --> 00:00:14.629
&gt;&gt; NORTH KOREA CLAIMED THEY

00:00:09.791 --> 00:00:14.963
DISMANTLED THEIR NUCLEAR TEST

00:00:14.763 --> 00:00:19.134
SITE.

00:00:15.097 --> 00:00:19.501
BROUGHT A GROUP TO WATCH THE

00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:21.837
EXPLOSION.

00:00:19.634 --> 00:00:23.872
I WOULDN'T SAY IT WAS

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:25.807
SPECTACULAR BUT THERE ARE NO

00:00:24.005 --> 00:00:26.875
INTERNATIONAL EXPERTS TO CONFIRM

00:00:25.941 --> 00:00:29.111
THE CLAIMS.

00:00:27.008 --> 00:00:32.214
THEN A FEW HOURS LATER THE

00:00:29.244 --> 00:00:33.115
CANCELLATION, FOR NOW AT LEAST,

00:00:32.347 --> 00:00:35.917
BY PRESIDENT TRUMP OF THE

00:00:33.248 --> 00:00:37.519
PLANNED SUMMIT IN SINGAPORE WITH

00:00:36.051 --> 00:00:45.961
KIM JONG-UN.

00:00:37.652 --> 00:00:47.429
THE SOUTH KOREAN PRESIDENT WITH

00:00:46.094 --> 00:00:48.830
PRESIDENT TRUMP SAID PERPLEXED

00:00:47.562 --> 00:00:52.834
BY THE NEWS.

00:00:50.665 --> 00:00:55.737
HE SAID DENUCLEARIZATION CAN'T

00:00:52.968 --> 00:00:58.507
BE DELAYED OR ABANDONED.

00:00:55.871 --> 00:01:00.709
MOON HAS MOVED TO BRING THE

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:02.244
CRISIS TO A DIMLY MAT I CAN

00:01:00.842 --> 00:01:10.252
RESOLUTION INCLUDING HIS OWN

00:01:02.377 --> 00:01:11.620
SUMMIT LAST MONTH WITH KIM KIM

00:01:10.385 --> 00:01:17.092
JONG-UN ON THE PUGH MZ.

00:01:11.753 --> 00:01:17.459
&gt;&gt; SOUTH KOREA HAS REACHED OUT

00:01:17.225 --> 00:01:21.930
PUBLICLY.

00:01:17.592 --> 00:01:22.631
&gt;&gt; REGIONAL OBSERVES ARE HOPING

00:01:22.063 --> 00:01:24.866
OUT HOPE.

00:01:22.764 --> 00:01:26.234
FOR NOW AT LEAST THEY SAY

00:01:26.368 --> 00:01:29.137
&gt;&gt; THIS IS A HUGE BUMP IN THE

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:30.806
ROAD.

00:01:29.271 --> 00:01:34.609
I SUPPOSE WE WILL HAVE TO WAIT

00:01:30.939 --> 00:01:37.012
TO SEE WHAT THE NORTH KOREAN

00:01:34.743 --> 00:01:37.946
REACTION IS AND THE REACTION OF

00:01:37.145 --> 00:01:41.950
OTHER PLAYERS AS WELL.

00:01:38.079 --> 00:01:45.787
&gt;&gt; IT IS EARLY FRIDAY MORNING

00:01:42.083 --> 00:01:47.556
HERE ON THE KOREAN PENINSULA.

00:01:45.921 --> 00:01:50.091
WE HAVEN'T HAD A REACTION YET

00:01:47.689 --> 00:01:51.493
FROM THE NORTH KOREAN GOVERNMENT

00:01:50.225 --> 00:01:53.728
TO THE WHITE HOUSE MOVES.

00:01:51.626 --> 00:01:56.264
THE REGIME HAS GOTTEN BETTER

00:01:53.862 --> 00:01:56.631
WITH THEIR REACTION TIME,

00:01:56.398 --> 00:01:58.800
RECENTLY.

00:01:56.765 --> 00:02:00.902
THEY MAY WANT TO CONSIDER WHAT

00:01:58.934 --> 00:02:01.269
IS NEXT AFTER THIS WHITE HOUSE

00:02:01.036 --> 00:02:03.271
DECISION.

00:02:01.403 --> 00:02:05.607
BACK TO YOU, BRET.

